<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">3. That you consider me for a return next year.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><span style=3D"font-size:12pt">There was a time I thought=
